#: src/HelcimPay/YSHelcimPayGateway.php:422
msgid "Helcim has no separate sandbox environment: to test, request a \"developer test account\" from Helcim and use that account's API token together with the official test card numbers."
msgstr "Helcim 沒有獨立的沙盒環境：如需測試，請向 Helcim 申請「開發者測試帳號」，並使用該帳號的 API token 搭配官方測試卡號。"

